<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 80.76 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 80.76 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 80.76 million rands worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling 180.58 million rands on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
